# rpg/art/doll/clips/kin_youth.clip: the youth's LOCO, RUN and DEATH clips (KIN-YOUTH, P2b wave 2). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# THE SIDE WALK AND RUN, the adult method at the youth's scale (KIN-YOUTH, P2b motion rollout 2026-10-22; docs/MOTION_P2.md 12;
# supersedes the side walk and run numbers below; the front and back walks and runs, idles, falls and postures unchanged):
#   walk (R, L): plants R 2:-1, -1:-4, -4:-7 (L a pixel forward): holds 3 / 3 / 3, an 18 px cycle; bob +1 on the contacts;
#     torso=run (each youth garment's side run view), hang=wide, neck flow (flow2 on the pass), hair=swing, tuft=down and
#     braid=swing on the pass (braid=rest else); the near arm B N F F N B against the near leg, the far hand `back` on
#     the reach and the next contact (the adult's timing);
#   run (R, L): plants R 0:-5, -5:-10, -10:-15 (L a pixel forward): holds 5 / 5 / 5, a 30 px cycle; bob 0 / -1 / -2 (the
#     contact lowest, both soles 2 rows up in the flight); lean 3 (head, torso and arms together; never a head offset) over
#     torso=runl (the garments' sheared run views) with the hip-anchored hangs on hip=1,0 (L -1,0); hang=flare, neck flow2,
#     braid=run (down her back), hair=swing on the push, tuft=down on the contact; the arms pump on the youth's own keys with
#     the adult's timing: near pB pM pF pF pK pB, far pF pK pB pB pM pF.
#   every side run line names hair=run (INTEGRATION 2026-10-23: ADULT-RIG's hair hangs' run views; the twin braids clear
#   the chest: W9); legs in kin/youth/legs/std (near) and far (far), feet boots_youth Y0-Y3, Y9.
# The youth is 26 px (STYLE_P2 3): the adult head box (crown F-25, chin F-14), the collar F-13, shoulders F-12 (12 px),
# the chest F-11..F-10, the belt F-9, the hem F-7, trousers to F-5, boots F-4..F-1, the sole F. Boys and girls share the
# body set; their garments are fitted per sex (`when girl replace` views) and the head box is the adult's of their sex.
# The side walk and run, the motion rebuild (2026-10-21, docs/MOTION_P2.md 5.4-5.5): the plants mark the planted HEEL (R walk
# 2:-1, -1:-4, -4:-6, cycle 16; R run 2:-3, -3:-7, -7:-13, cycle 30; the L views' plants the R's + 1), the same advances
# as before, so the cadence is unchanged; the feet are one boot angled through the stride (kin/youth/legs/std.pxm). The
# notes below on flat soles and lifted boots are history for the side views.
# The owner's walk rules hold (STYLE_P2 10): every leg keeps the idle's mass, the boots are the idle boot moved and
# lifted (flat soles), the hips bob 0 / +1 / 0, the planted leg straight under the hips. The walk: the planted foot steps
# 3 / 3 / 2 px (a 16 px cycle; the front and back walks walk in place on the same table); the run: 5 / 4 / 6 (a 30 px
# cycle, above the gait switch; 2026-10-20 leg pass: the side contact's planted boot a pixel further forward, so the
# compact contact keeps a pixel of air between the boots and each leg its two trouser rows). The left views' plants are the right view's + 1 (the left legs sit a pixel forward, as
# the adult's do). Arms swing for everyone (no youth carries a sheathed weapon).

body youth
anchors D head=-8,-27 neck=0,-13 hip=0,-8 shoulderR=-6,-12 shoulderL=5,-12
anchors U head=-8,-27 neck=0,-13 hip=0,-8 shoulderR=5,-12 shoulderL=-6,-12
anchors R head=-8,-27 neck=0,-13 hip=0,-8 shoulderR=-1,-12 shoulderL=-1,-12
anchors L head=-8,-27 neck=0,-13 hip=0,-8 shoulderR=-1,-12 shoulderL=-1,-12

clip idle D
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest bob=-1
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest expr=blink
clip idle U
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest bob=-1
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest
clip idle R
f armL=- armR=idle legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest
f armL=- armR=idle legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest bob=-1
f armL=- armR=idle legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest expr=blink
clip idle L
f armL=idle armR=- legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest
f armL=idle armR=- legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest bob=-1
f armL=idle armR=- legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest expr=blink

clip walk D
f armL=fwd armR=back legs=walkA torso=rest hang=rest sway=-1 plant=6:3
f armL=fwd armR=back legs=walkA2 torso=rest hang=rest tuft=down hair=swing bob=1 hip=0,-1 sway=-1 plant=3:0
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=walkB torso=rest hang=rest tuft=up plant=0:-2
f armL=back armR=fwd legs=walkC torso=rest hang=rest sway=1 plant=6:3
f armL=back armR=fwd legs=walkC2 torso=rest hang=rest tuft=down hair=swing bob=1 hip=0,-1 sway=1 plant=3:0
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=walkD torso=rest hang=rest tuft=up plant=0:-2
clip walk U
f armL=back armR=fwd legs=walkA torso=rest hang=rest sway=-1 plant=6:3
f armL=back armR=fwd legs=walkA2 torso=rest hang=rest tuft=down hair=swing bob=1 hip=0,-1 sway=-1 plant=3:0
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=walkB torso=rest hang=rest tuft=up plant=0:-2
f armL=fwd armR=back legs=walkC torso=rest hang=rest sway=1 plant=6:3
f armL=fwd armR=back legs=walkC2 torso=rest hang=rest tuft=down hair=swing bob=1 hip=0,-1 sway=1 plant=3:0
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=walkD torso=rest hang=rest tuft=up plant=0:-2
# the side pass frames (walkB2 / walkD2) take hang=wide (motion fix round 1): the rest hang, a coat to the knee, hid the
# knee row and the shins of the passing legs; wide is cut above the knee in every side walk and run key. Motion fix round
# 3 (R3-06): the side wide / flare hangs end a row higher (the thighs show) and the down frames drop hip=0,-1, so the
# hem rides down with the body (as the adult's torso=run does) instead of opening a row over the seat.
clip walk R
f armL=- armR=B legs=walkA neck=flow torso=run hang=wide braid=rest bob=1 plant=2:-1
f armL=- armR=N legs=walkA2 neck=flow2 torso=run hang=wide hair=swing tuft=down braid=swing plant=-1:-4
f armL=back armR=F legs=walkB2 neck=flow torso=run hang=wide braid=rest plant=-4:-7
f armL=back armR=F legs=walkC neck=flow torso=run hang=wide braid=rest bob=1 plant=2:-1
f armL=- armR=N legs=walkC2 neck=flow2 torso=run hang=wide hair=swing tuft=down braid=swing plant=-1:-4
f armL=- armR=B legs=walkD2 neck=flow torso=run hang=wide braid=rest plant=-4:-7
clip walk L
f armR=- armL=B legs=walkA neck=flow torso=run hang=wide braid=rest bob=1 plant=3:0
f armR=- armL=N legs=walkA2 neck=flow2 torso=run hang=wide hair=swing tuft=down braid=swing plant=0:-3
f armR=back armL=F legs=walkB2 neck=flow torso=run hang=wide braid=rest plant=-3:-6
f armR=back armL=F legs=walkC neck=flow torso=run hang=wide braid=rest bob=1 plant=3:0
f armR=- armL=N legs=walkC2 neck=flow2 torso=run hang=wide hair=swing tuft=down braid=swing plant=0:-3
f armR=- armL=B legs=walkD2 neck=flow torso=run hang=wide braid=rest plant=-3:-6

clip hurt D
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest expr=hurt bob=-1
clip hurt U
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest bob=-1
clip hurt R
f armL=- armR=idle legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest expr=hurt bob=-1
clip hurt L
f armL=idle armR=- legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest expr=hurt bob=-1

# the run (RUN part): contact, push, flight x 2; the torso a pixel forward in side views, the hips a pixel up in flight;
# the arms bent and pumping; hangs flare
clip run D
f armL=runF armR=back legs=run1 torso=rest hang=flare sway=-1 plant=5:0
f armL=runF armR=back legs=run2 torso=rest hang=flare hair=swing tuft=down sway=-1 plant=0:-4
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=run3 torso=rest hang=flare tuft=up bob=-1 plant=-4:-10
f armL=back armR=runF legs=run4 torso=rest hang=flare sway=1 plant=5:0
f armL=back armR=runF legs=run5 torso=rest hang=flare hair=swing tuft=down sway=1 plant=0:-4
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=run6 torso=rest hang=flare tuft=up bob=-1 plant=-4:-10
clip run U
f armL=back armR=runF legs=run1 torso=rest hang=flare sway=-1 plant=5:0
f armL=back armR=runF legs=run2 torso=rest hang=flare hair=swing tuft=down sway=-1 plant=0:-4
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=run3 torso=rest hang=flare tuft=up bob=-1 plant=-4:-10
f armL=runF armR=back legs=run4 torso=rest hang=flare sway=1 plant=5:0
f armL=runF armR=back legs=run5 torso=rest hang=flare hair=swing tuft=down sway=1 plant=0:-4
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=run6 torso=rest hang=flare tuft=up bob=-1 plant=-4:-10
clip run R
f armL=pF armR=pB legs=run1 neck=flow2 torso=runl hang=flare lean=3 hip=1,0 tuft=down hair=run braid=run plant=0:-5
f armL=pK armR=pM legs=run2 neck=flow2 torso=runl hang=flare lean=3 hip=1,0 hair=run braid=run bob=-1 plant=-5:-10
f armL=pB armR=pF legs=run3 neck=flow2 torso=runl hang=flare lean=3 hip=1,0 hair=run braid=run bob=-2 plant=-10:-15
f armL=pB armR=pF legs=run4 neck=flow2 torso=runl hang=flare lean=3 hip=1,0 tuft=down hair=run braid=run plant=0:-5
f armL=pM armR=pK legs=run5 neck=flow2 torso=runl hang=flare lean=3 hip=1,0 hair=run braid=run bob=-1 plant=-5:-10
f armL=pF armR=pB legs=run6 neck=flow2 torso=runl hang=flare lean=3 hip=1,0 hair=run braid=run bob=-2 plant=-10:-15
clip run L
f armR=pF armL=pB legs=run1 neck=flow2 torso=runl hang=flare lean=-3 hip=-1,0 tuft=down hair=run braid=run plant=1:-4
f armR=pK armL=pM legs=run2 neck=flow2 torso=runl hang=flare lean=-3 hip=-1,0 hair=run braid=run bob=-1 plant=-4:-9
f armR=pB armL=pF legs=run3 neck=flow2 torso=runl hang=flare lean=-3 hip=-1,0 hair=run braid=run bob=-2 plant=-9:-14
f armR=pB armL=pF legs=run4 neck=flow2 torso=runl hang=flare lean=-3 hip=-1,0 tuft=down hair=run braid=run plant=1:-4
f armR=pM armL=pK legs=run5 neck=flow2 torso=runl hang=flare lean=-3 hip=-1,0 hair=run braid=run bob=-1 plant=-4:-9
f armR=pF armL=pB legs=run6 neck=flow2 torso=runl hang=flare lean=-3 hip=-1,0 hair=run braid=run bob=-2 plant=-9:-14

# the fall (STYLE_P2 13): recoil (the hurt face, the head snapped back), buckle (the knees give, the head bowed), topple
# (the lying figure 2 px up and 2 px toward where the body stood); lying: the left view laid down (variant 0 west, 1 east)
# from the painted lying keys (legs toes-up, the near arm limp, the garment and skirt draped, the hair pressed flat)
clip fall D variant 0
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest expr=hurt bob=-1 head=0,-1
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=buckle torso=rest hang=kneel expr=hurt bob=2 head=0,1
f armL=lie armR=- legs=lie torso=lie hang=lie hair=lie neck=lie expr=closed hairpose=lie hatpose=lie head=-2,0 turn=west at=2,-2
clip fall D variant 1
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest expr=hurt bob=-1 head=0,-1
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=buckle torso=rest hang=kneel expr=hurt bob=2 head=0,1
f armL=lie armR=- legs=lie torso=lie hang=lie hair=lie neck=lie expr=closed hairpose=lie hatpose=lie head=-2,0 turn=east at=-2,-2
clip fall U variant 0
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest bob=-1 head=0,-1
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=buckle torso=rest hang=kneel bob=2 head=0,1
f armL=lie armR=- legs=lie torso=lie hang=lie hair=lie neck=lie expr=closed hairpose=lie hatpose=lie head=-2,0 turn=west at=2,-2
clip fall U variant 1
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest bob=-1 head=0,-1
f armL=idle armR=idle legs=buckle torso=rest hang=kneel bob=2 head=0,1
f armL=lie armR=- legs=lie torso=lie hang=lie hair=lie neck=lie expr=closed hairpose=lie hatpose=lie head=-2,0 turn=east at=-2,-2
clip fall R variant 0
f armL=- armR=idle legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest expr=hurt bob=-1 lean=-1
f armL=- armR=idle legs=buckle torso=rest hang=kneel expr=hurt bob=2 head=1,1
f armL=lie armR=- legs=lie torso=lie hang=lie hair=lie neck=lie expr=closed hairpose=lie hatpose=lie head=-2,0 turn=west at=2,-2
clip fall R variant 1
f armL=- armR=idle legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest expr=hurt bob=-1 lean=-1
f armL=- armR=idle legs=buckle torso=rest hang=kneel expr=hurt bob=2 head=1,1
f armL=lie armR=- legs=lie torso=lie hang=lie hair=lie neck=lie expr=closed hairpose=lie hatpose=lie head=-2,0 turn=east at=-2,-2
clip fall L variant 0
f armL=idle armR=- legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest expr=hurt bob=-1 lean=1
f armL=idle armR=- legs=buckle torso=rest hang=kneel expr=hurt bob=2 head=-1,1
f armL=lie armR=- legs=lie torso=lie hang=lie hair=lie neck=lie expr=closed hairpose=lie hatpose=lie head=-2,0 turn=west at=2,-2
clip fall L variant 1
f armL=idle armR=- legs=idle torso=rest hang=rest expr=hurt bob=-1 lean=1
f armL=idle armR=- legs=buckle torso=rest hang=kneel expr=hurt bob=2 head=-1,1
f armL=lie armR=- legs=lie torso=lie hang=lie hair=lie neck=lie expr=closed hairpose=lie hatpose=lie head=-2,0 turn=east at=-2,-2
clip lying L variant 0
f armL=lie armR=- legs=lie torso=lie hang=lie hair=lie neck=lie expr=closed hairpose=lie hatpose=lie head=-2,0
clip lying L variant 1
f armL=lie armR=- legs=lie torso=lie hang=lie hair=lie neck=lie expr=closed hairpose=lie hatpose=lie head=-2,0

# ---- postures (KIN-YOUTH): what the census's youths do (life_game.cpp: meals at the table or on the floor, eating and
# drinking on their feet, waving, tag, sleep). Leg modes: sit (chair: the hip mark on the seat line 7 rows over the floor;
# the youth's hips are at seat height already, so no bob), cross (floor: the hips 2 rows over the floor, bob 6), the
# standing and the run's legs. The prop in hand is the posture's (doll postureProp) on the right hand's grip mark; the
# right hand does the work in every facing (facing left as the far arm), the near hand waves.
clip idle D posture sit
f armL=lap armR=lap hang=sit legs=sit torso=rest
clip idle D posture siteat
f armL=hold armR=mouth held=mouth hang=sit legs=sit torso=rest
f armL=hold armR=hold held=hold hang=sit legs=sit torso=rest
clip idle D posture sitdrink
f armL=lap armR=mouth held=mouth hang=sit legs=sit torso=rest
f armL=lap armR=hold held=hold hang=sit legs=sit torso=rest
clip idle D posture sitfloor
f armL=knee armR=knee hang=floor legs=cross torso=rest bob=6
clip idle D posture sitflooreat
