# ---- Dance and Cheer (DOLL-C, P2c wave 2 round 2): the youth was drawn from a v1 sheet at rig 2 when the sim gave it
#      Dance (hopscotch at play, life_game playTag; the festival night) or Cheer (the festival toast from SitDrink). Dance:
#      the turning step of the adult and the child, the arms up and out by turns, a hop on the planted beat (bob -2, the
#      youth's legs have no hop view: the idle legs lifted whole); Cheer: the mug raised
#      on wave2 (the adult mug's `raise` view floats off the youth's raised fist), a lift on the beat.
clip idle D posture dance
f armL=hold armR=raise legs=walkA torso=rest hang=rest
f armL=wave2 armR=wave legs=idle torso=rest hang=flare bob=-2
f armL=raise armR=hold legs=walkC torso=rest hang=rest
f armL=wave armR=wave2 legs=idle torso=rest hang=flare bob=-2 expr=talk
